      "id": "calculate-incidence",
      "name": "Calculate Incidence",
      "description": "This wizard will calculate the incidence for a particular clinical condition. This calculation is done in SQL, and this works by finding the first instance of the condition (the diagnostic code) and determining if it occurs between a particular set of dates that you specify.",
